        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Ebr 9:4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kesho yake asubuhi, Mose alikwenda katika hema la mkutano. Humo, aliikuta fimbo ya Aroni wa kabila la Lawi, imechipua na kutoa vichipukizi vilivyochanua maua na kuzaa matunda mabivu ya mlozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Mose akazitoa fimbo zote hapo mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, akawaonesha Waisraeli wote, na kila kiongozi akachukua fimbo yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, “Irudishe fimbo ya Aroni mbele ya sanduku la agano. Hiyo itatunzwa mahali hapo, na ni onyo kwa waasi hao kwamba wasipoacha kuninungunikia, watakufa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akafanya kama alivyoamriwa na Mwenyezi-Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
